{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPoint(im)replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the same number of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertices from a given C array.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@_NSRange","text":"NSRange"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"range"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"withCoordinates:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CLLocationCoordinate2D","text":"CLLocationCoordinate2D"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"coords"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of vertices to replace. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"location"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first vertex you are replacing, with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" being the first vertex, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being the second vertex, and so on. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates the number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of vertices to replace."}]}],"name":"range"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The array of coordinates defining part of the shape. The data in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this array is copied to the shape’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coordinates"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}]}],"name":"coords"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the shape is currently visible on the map as an annotation, it is redrawn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"immediately. If the shape is part of an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object, you must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"explicitly set the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property in order for any style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layers that use the source to be redrawn."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of coordinates in "},{"code":"coords","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must be equal to the length of "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you want to insert or delete one or more vertices, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extends beyond the shape’s "},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"NSRangeException","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is raised. If you want to append new vertices to the shape,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use the "},{"code":"-appendCoordinates:count:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:"}],"title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the same number of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices from a given C array."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShape"}],"title":"MLNShape","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/shape":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The contents of the source. A shape can represent a GeoJSON geometry, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature, or a collection of features."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/shape","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","title":"shape","fragments":[{"text":"shape","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class is an abstract superclass used to define shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"composed of multiple vertices."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPoint","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNMultiPoint","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or they may be defined by local or external"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" code. A shape source is added to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can update a shape source by setting its "},{"code":"shape","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSource"}],"title":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy object for the current map style."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNStyle"}],"title":"MLNStyle","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/ML